# Code-MaxCap-BD-RIS-MIMO/paper_TSP
This folder contains code related to the paper "The manifold of unitary and symmetric matrices: Characterization,
Riemannian optimization and application to BD-RIS design,"  I. Santamaria, C. Beltran, E. Jorswieck, M. Soleymani, and J. Gutierrez.

# Content of Code Package
The code is implemented in Matlab.
The files Script_FigXX reproduce Fig. XX in the manuscript.

